OL,3,GNEWSADeli boss praises reduction in
OL,4,Apavement licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Herefordshire business owner says she
OL,7,Fis "really grateful" for a 70%
OL,8,Freduction in in pavement licence fees.
OL,10,FSamantha Morgan, from Drapers Lane Deli
OL,11,Fin Leominster, said the move would
OL,12,Fbenefit the whole high street, not just
OL,13,Fhospitality.
OL,15,F"It's about people spending much longer
OL,16,Fin Leominster and if someone sits
OL,17,Foutside with a coffee for 20 minutes
OL,18,Fthey'll often wander into two or three
OL,19,Fshops afterwards," she said, adding:
OL,20,F"That's really good for the whole town
OL,21,Fcentre."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
