OL,3,GNEWSADeli boss praises reduction in
OL,4,Apavement licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pavement licence is an official
OL,7,Fpermit issued by the local authority
OL,8,Fthat allows food and drink businesses
OL,9,Fto place removable furniture like
OL,10,Ftables and chairs on the pavement
OL,11,Foutside its premises.
